  - id: the_god_of_all_comfort
    displayName: The God of All Comfort
    flavorText: Paul blesses God as the Father of mercies who comforts believers
      in every tribulation so that they can pass that same comfort on to others in
      trouble.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: God comforts believers in their tribulation specifically so they can
      comfort others in trouble, framing affliction as purposeful rather than meaningless.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_2cor
    managerId: comfort_in_affliction_law
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
