  - id: touch_not_the_unclean_thing
    displayName: Touch Not the Unclean Thing
    flavorText: Paul warns believers not to be unequally yoked with unbelievers and
      calls the church to come out and be separate, perfecting holiness out of reverence
      for God.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Believers should not be unequally yoked with unbelievers, since righteousness
      and unrighteousness cannot genuinely partner together; the church is called
      to separate itself and perfect holiness.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_2cor
    managerId: unequally_yoked_law
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 458.9458124211011
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
